  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "review-fc9ced8411fd-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC3",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "batch_integration.ts:130 从包含 Lane 修改的 merged tree 读取 declaration，使执行模型能够扩大自动解决冲突的权限。应使用 batch 启动时冻结的 declaration，并补充 Lane 擅自增加 output 或替换 check 时仍拒绝冲突的测试。docs/specs/branch-boundary-r2.spec.md 的 Threat model 明确只信任 batch 启动时提交的 docs/agents/ 声明；读取该未修改文件是为核实本变更跨越的 authority boundary。",
      "anchor": "sha256:49403639d873e803c23912d76f4a1a4160e7c9db995f2dd1114c8ac53a0de3d3",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "batch 启动时 ordinary.txt 不是 declared output；Parent 与 Lane 对它产生冲突，而 Lane 同时修改 docs/agents/derived-files.json，将 ordinary.txt 加入 outputs 并提供覆盖它的 generate 和恒成功 check → buildCandidate 使用 merged declaration 接受该源文件冲突并覆盖 Parent 的内容，而不是报告 conflict。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_integration.ts::prepareLaneCandidate",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_integration.ts::buildCandidate",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/derived_files.ts::readDerivedFiles",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/derived_files.ts::runDerivedCommand"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "security_boundary",
          "ref": "batch-start-derived-declaration-authority"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "review-fc9ced8411fd-2-review-2",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "AC2",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "batch_integration.ts:138–142 检查工作树，却用可被 generator 修改的 index 构建最终 tree，未能保证 merged sources 保持不变。应在 write-tree 后比较初始 merged tree 与最终 tree 的实际路径、blob 和 mode，仅允许 declared outputs 变化，并补充 index-only 源文件篡改的拒绝测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:cb41f029bb591540b058c1b870a07926e8e5eb3ff3903f4271f3bc6bb04c6b21",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "declared output 发生冲突；Lane 修改的 generator 正常生成 output，同时通过 git update-index --cacheinfo 把未声明源文件 a.txt 的另一个 blob 写入临时 index，保持 a.txt 工作树内容不变，check 返回成功 → git diff HEAD 看不到 a.txt 的 index-only 修改，但 write-tree 将被篡改的 a.txt 纳入候选；重复构建得到同一 tree 后 laneCandidateMatches 也会接受，导致集成内容包含并非来自 merged sources 的源文件修改。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_integration.ts::prepareLaneCandidate",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_integration.ts::buildCandidate",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/derived_files.ts::runDerivedCommand",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/unattended/batch_integration.ts::laneCandidateMatches"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "security_boundary",
          "ref": "derived-regeneration-preserves-merged-source-tree"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    }
  ],
